p>MarketPG may use essential session technologies and, when enabled, third-party advertising services such as Google. Those providers may use cookies or similar technologies under their own policies and settings.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions or requests, contact the MarketPG support team through the contact channel published in the app or website.</p>@endsection